# Credits

Every bundled third-party asset has exactly one row. `genesis-verify` fails when a file
under a `credits-paths:` directory (declared in `.claude/skill-profile.md`) has no row
here. CC BY credits must also be reachable in the app; CC BY-SA and NC assets need an ADR
before they are bundled into a closed-source binary.

| Path | Source | Licence | Credit string |
|---|---|---|---|
